%% Search -> select -> delete data flow for @liiift-studio/sanity-search-and-delete
%% Reproducible source. Render with: npm run capture
flowchart TD
    A[Enter search term + pick document type] --> B[GROQ query runs via Sanity client]
    B --> C{Results found?}
    C -->|No| A
    C -->|Yes| D[Review matched documents in list]
    D --> E[Select the documents to delete]
    E --> F{Danger mode unlocked<br/>and confirmation given?}
    F -->|No - blocked| D
    F -->|Yes| G[Batched delete via Sanity client]
    G --> H[(Documents permanently removed<br/>cannot be undone)]

    classDef danger fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#922,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef gate fill:#fff6e5,stroke:#e6a23c,color:#8a6d3b;
    classDef store fill:#eef4fb,stroke:#3b78c3,color:#234;
    class H danger;
    class F,C gate;
    class B,G store;
